  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Northern Kings Defeated",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jabin king of Hazor heard of this, he sent word to Jobab king of Madon, to the kings of Shimron and Akshaph,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to the northern kings who were in the mountains, in the Arabah south of Kinnereth, in the western foothills and in Naphoth Dor on the west;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the Canaanites in the east and west; to the Amorites, Hittites, Perizzites and Jebusites in the hill country; and to the Hivites below Hermon in the region of Mizpah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They came out with all their troops and a large number of horses and chariots—a huge army, as numerous as the sand on the seashore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these kings joined forces and made camp together at the Waters of Merom to fight against Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Joshua, \"Do not be afraid of them, because by this time tomorrow I will hand all of them, slain, over to Israel. You are to hamstring their horses and burn their chariots.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Joshua and his whole army came against them suddenly at the Waters of Merom and attacked them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave them into the hand of Israel. They defeated them and pursued them all the way to Greater Sidon, to Misrephoth Maim, and to the Valley of Mizpah on the east, until no survivors were left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua did to them as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had directed: He hamstrung their horses and burned their chariots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Joshua turned back and captured Hazor and put its king to the sword. (Hazor had been the head of all these kingdoms.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone in it they put to the sword. They totally destroyed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "them, not sparing anyone that breathed, and he burned Hazor itself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua took all these royal cities and their kings and put them to the sword. He totally destroyed them, as Moses the servant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet Israel did not burn any of the cities built on their mounds—except Hazor, which Joshua burned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Israelites carried off for themselves all the plunder and livestock of these cities, but all the people they put to the sword until they completely destroyed them, not sparing anyone that breathed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded his servant Moses, so Moses commanded Joshua, and Joshua did it; he left nothing undone of all that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Joshua took this entire land: the hill country, all the Negev, the whole region of Goshen, the western foothills, the Arabah and the mountains of Israel with their foothills,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from Mount Halak, which rises toward Seir, to Baal Gad in the Valley of Lebanon below Mount Hermon. He captured all their kings and put them to death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua waged war against all these kings for a long time.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Except for the Hivites living in Gibeon, not one city made a treaty of peace with the Israelites, who took them all in battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it was the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "himself who hardened their hearts to wage war against Israel, so that he might destroy them totally, exterminating them without mercy, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Joshua went and destroyed the Anakites from the hill country: from Hebron, Debir and Anab, from all the hill country of Judah, and from all the hill country of Israel. Joshua totally destroyed them and their towns.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No Anakites were left in Israelite territory; only in Gaza, Gath and Ashdod did any survive.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Joshua took the entire land, just as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.11.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had directed Moses, and he gave it as an inheritance to Israel according to their tribal divisions. Then the land had rest from war.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JOS.12",
    "number": "12",
    "bookId": "JOS"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "JOS.10",
    "number": "10",
